build: 2026-06-22 v10.39.2 (Stereo image + adaptive brightness + resilient deploy)
branch: claude/piano-roll-clip-view-wozlie
notes: SOUND POLISH (2 fixes) + DEPLOY RESILIENCE. (1) STABLE STEREO IMAGE — synth voices pan by PITCH (low→left, high→right, gentle) instead of by the reused voice-slot index, so fast/arpeggiated notes no longer wobble across the stereo field; the mono sub keeps the low end anchored. (2) ADAPTIVE BRIGHTNESS — the per-genre brightness/upper-partial lift now scales with how dull the genre already is, so dull genres still read brighter on device (the founder's goal) while already-bright genres are no longer over-brightened/harsh. (3) DEPLOY: the TestFlight upload step now retries Apple's TRANSIENT App Store Connect errors too (HTTP 503 "Service Temporarily Unavailable", auth/"No Accounts with App Store Connect Access", unexpected-content, timeouts) with backoff — the v10.38.0/v10.39.0/v10.39.1 upload failures were all this Apple-side flakiness, not the build. Carries everything from v10.39.0: komische-Töne sound fixes (stuck/off-pitch sub drone + steal portamento) + Automation (Master/Tempo lanes) + MIDI import (melody + GM drums) + Audio Clips + Unison. All Xcode-Compile-Check green per commit.
